		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Cacher le mot de passe?]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=33986#p33986"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>pour me connecter voici ce que j&#039;utilise</p><p>conn&lt;-DBI::dbConnect(drv = RPostgres::Postgres(),<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;host =&quot;localhost&quot;, <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; port =5432, <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; dbname = &quot;test&quot;,<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; user = rstudioapi::askForPassword(&quot;Nom d&#039;utilisateur:&quot;),<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; password = rstudioapi::askForPassword(&quot;Mot de passe: &quot;))</p>]]></content>
